// A buried cargo halt, from the platform hall west into the warehouse to the chest: up over the crate stacks
// (W held climbs them like any wall) and down again; the chest opens when the mole walks up to it. The halt
// is 80 m long, so the scenario starts inside (the harness world is 128 m wide). Layouts from PR #8.
